SELECT 'CASL AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate Training Singapore: SAA-C03 Exam Domains and Funding', 'casl-aws-certified-solutions-architect-associate-training-singapore-guide', 'AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate is one of the most recognised credentials in cloud, and SAA-C03 is the exam that makes it verifiable to an employer. This guide makes the case for actually booking the exam, breaks down every domain and weighting, and sets out the CASL funding - up to 70%, or up to 90% for Singapore Citizens aged 40 and above. Train with us and sit the exam at our own Pearson VUE test centre.',
       '<div class="mmd-summary"><div class="mmd-summary-label">Summary</div><p>AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate is an associate-level AWS credential and one of the most recognised certifications in cloud computing. This guide makes the case for actually sitting <strong>SAA-C03</strong>, breaks down every exam domain and its weighting, and sets out the funding that brings the S$1,500 course fee down sharply for eligible learners. AWS exams are delivered through Pearson VUE, and Tertiary Infotech Academy is a <strong>Pearson VUE Authorized Test Center</strong> - so you can train and sit the exam at the same address.</p></div><h2>Why you should actually sit the exam</h2><p>Plenty of people attend cloud training and never book the exam. That is the single biggest waste in professional development, because <strong>the training teaches you the skill, but only the certification is visible to anyone else</strong>. Here is the honest case for booking SAA-C03.</p><ul><li><strong>Recruiters filter on it before a human reads your CV.</strong> Search any Singapore job board for cloud roles and the certification is named in the requirements. Applicant tracking systems match on that string. Without the credential you are often filtered out before your experience is ever assessed.</li><li><strong>It is externally verifiable.</strong> Anyone can claim AWS experience. An AWS certification is issued by Amazon, carries a verification number, and can be checked by an employer in seconds. That asymmetry is precisely why it carries weight.</li><li><strong>It pays.</strong> AWS certifications appear year after year at the top of global IT salary surveys, with the professional-level credentials among the highest paying of any certification in technology. The exam fee is a rounding error against a single salary revision.</li><li><strong>The deadline is what makes you learn.</strong> A booked exam date converts good intentions into study. Learners who book the exam before the course ends pass at far higher rates than those who leave it open-ended, because the material is still fresh and there is a date to work towards.</li><li><strong>It benefits your employer directly.</strong> AWS Partner Network membership tiers are calculated from the number of certified staff an organisation holds. Your certification is a business asset, which is a persuasive argument when asking your company to sponsor the exam fee.</li><li><strong>It compounds.</strong> AWS certifications ladder deliberately - foundational to associate to professional and specialty. Each one you hold makes the next materially easier, and the ladder is the clearest structured path in cloud.</li></ul><p>The exam costs <strong>USD 150</strong> and takes 130 minutes. Set against the salary and mobility it unlocks - and against a course fee that funding already reduces sharply - it is one of the highest-return decisions available to a technology professional in Singapore. <strong>Book it before you finish the course.</strong></p><p>One practical note: AWS gives every certification holder a <strong>50% discount voucher towards their next exam</strong>, plus access to official practice material. Passing one exam makes the next one cheaper, so the ladder gets less expensive as you climb it.</p><h2>Why AWS certifications carry weight</h2><p>AWS has held the largest share of the global cloud infrastructure market for over a decade, and Singapore is one of its most established regions - AWS has operated an Asia Pacific (Singapore) Region since 2010 and has committed billions to local infrastructure. The practical consequence for your career is simple: <strong>more Singapore employers run workloads on AWS than on any other cloud</strong>, so an AWS credential is the one most likely to match the stack you will actually be hired to work on.</p><ul><li><strong>Role-based, not product-trivia.</strong> AWS certifications are built from job-task analysis of real roles, so the exam tests the decisions the role requires rather than memorised service limits.</li><li><strong>Scenario-based questions.</strong> Associate and professional exams present multi-sentence scenarios with several technically valid answers, and ask for the best one given cost, resilience or security constraints. That is hard to pass without real understanding.</li><li><strong>A deliberate ladder.</strong> Foundational, associate, professional and specialty tiers give a structured progression, each level building on the last.</li><li><strong>Recertification keeps it current.</strong> Credentials are valid for three years, so a current certification means current knowledge - which is exactly why employers trust it in a field that changes this quickly.</li></ul><p>Solutions Architect Associate is the single most in-demand AWS certification and consistently among the highest-paying IT credentials worldwide. It is the credential that moves you from ''can use AWS'' to ''can design on AWS'', and it is the one most Singapore cloud job postings name explicitly.</p><h2>The SAA-C03 exam at a glance</h2><table><tbody><tr><th>Certification</th><td>AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate</td></tr><tr><th>Exam code</th><td>SAA-C03</td></tr><tr><th>Level</th><td>Associate</td></tr><tr><th>Format</th><td>65 questions (multiple choice and multiple response)</td></tr><tr><th>Duration</th><td>130 minutes</td></tr><tr><th>Passing score</th><td>720 out of 1000</td></tr><tr><th>Exam fee</th><td>USD 150 (paid to AWS, not included in the course fee)</td></tr><tr><th>Validity</th><td>Valid for 3 years</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Recommended background.</strong> AWS recommends at least one year of hands-on experience designing on AWS. Cloud Practitioner is a useful precursor but is not required.</p><h2>SAA-C03 exam domains and weightings</h2><p>Read the weightings as a study budget. The heaviest domain deserves proportionally more of your practice time, and on a scored exam it is where marks are won or lost.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Exam domain</th><th>Weighting</th><th>What it covers</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Design Secure Architectures</strong></td><td>30%</td><td>The largest domain: secure access to AWS resources with IAM, secure workloads and application tiers, and appropriate data security controls including encryption at rest and in transit.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Resilient Architectures</strong></td><td>26%</td><td>Scalable and loosely coupled architectures, highly available and fault-tolerant designs, decoupling with SQS/SNS/EventBridge, and multi-AZ and multi-Region strategies.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design High-Performing Architectures</strong></td><td>24%</td><td>Choosing performant storage, compute, database and networking solutions, and designing data ingestion and transformation for the workload at hand.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Design Cost-Optimized Architectures</strong></td><td>20%</td><td>Cost-effective storage, compute, database and network architectures, right-sizing, and selecting the correct pricing model for the workload.</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the CASL course covers</h2><p>Our <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/casl-aws-certified-solutions-architect-associate-training.html">CASL - AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate Training</a> is instructor-led and hands-on, mapped to the SAA-C03 objectives above and delivered in our Woodlands Square training centre, with live online and hybrid options available. Because it is a CASL-approved programme it carries the funding below and is assessed, so you leave with a Statement of Attainment as well as exam readiness.</p><p><strong>Typical roles this leads to:</strong> Solutions Architect, Cloud Engineer, DevOps Engineer, Technical Lead, Systems Engineer.</p><h2>Sit your AWS exam at our test centre</h2><blockquote><p><strong>We are a Pearson VUE Authorized Test Center.</strong> AWS certification exams are delivered through the Pearson VUE network, and our centre is one of them - so you can book and sit your proctored SAA-C03 exam at our training centre at 12 Woodlands Square, in the same room you studied in.</p></blockquote><p>That removes the usual friction: no unfamiliar venue, no weeks of drift between finishing the course and finding a slot. You register the exam directly with AWS through Pearson VUE and choose our centre as your location. If you would rather sit it at home, AWS also offers online proctored delivery through Pearson VUE OnVUE.</p><h2>What you will actually pay: funding for AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate training</h2><p>This is a <strong>CASL-approved course (course reference <code>TGS-2026064535</code>)</strong>, so the published fee of <strong>S$1,500</strong> is not what most learners pay. The schemes stack, applied in order: baseline subsidy first, then credits and claims against the balance.</p><h3>1. Baseline CASL course fee funding</h3><p>Eligible Singapore Citizens and Permanent Residents receive <strong>up to 70% course fee funding</strong>. Singapore Citizens aged 40 and above qualify for <strong>up to 90% under the Mid-Career Enhanced Subsidy (MCES)</strong>. SME-sponsored employees may also qualify for the enhanced rate. Funding is subject to eligibility and to meeting the attendance and assessment requirements.</p><h3>2. SkillsFuture Enterprise Credit (SFEC)</h3><p>Sponsoring employees? Eligible Singapore-registered companies can draw on <strong>up to $10,000 of SFEC</strong> to cover out-of-pocket costs. Look the course up on <a href="https://skillsfuture.gobusiness.gov.sg/course-directory/courses/TGS-2026064535" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SkillsFuture for Business</a>.</p><h3>3. PSEA</h3><p>Eligible Singapore Citizens can pay the remaining fee from their <strong>Post-Secondary Education Account</strong>. Check the course listing on MySkillsFuture and look under &ldquo;Keyword Tags&rdquo; for a PSEA tag to confirm eligibility, then submit a PSEA withdrawal form to us.</p><h3>4. UTAP</h3><p>NTUC members can claim <strong>50% of the unfunded course fee</strong> through the Union Training Assistance Programme, capped at $250 per year, or <strong>$500 per year for members aged 40 and above</strong>. Claims are submitted after course completion via the <a href="https://utap.ntuc.org.sg/onlineClaim" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NTUC UTAP portal</a>. UTAP support is subject to the course remaining UTAP-eligible at the time of your claim.</p><h3>5. Absentee Payroll</h3><p>Employers sponsoring staff may claim <strong>Absentee Payroll</strong> to offset the salary cost of the hours their employee spends in training, subject to the prevailing SSG rates and caps.</p><p><em>The AWS exam fee of USD 150 is paid separately to AWS and is not covered by course fee funding. All funding is subject to eligibility and to prevailing SSG policies at the time of course commencement - talk to us and we will work out your exact nett fee.</em></p><h2>Your route to certification</h2><ol><li><strong>Check your funding eligibility.</strong> Citizenship, age band and employer sponsorship determine whether you pay 30%, 10% or less of the published fee.</li><li><strong>Register for the course.</strong> Pick a class date on the <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/casl-aws-certified-solutions-architect-associate-training.html">course page</a> and reserve your seat.</li><li><strong>Book the exam before the course ends.</strong> Create an AWS Certification account, schedule SAA-C03 through Pearson VUE, and pick our test centre. A booked date is what turns intent into a pass.</li><li><strong>Attend the training.</strong> Complete the hands-on labs and the CASL assessment to earn your Statement of Attainment.</li><li><strong>Sit the exam while it is fresh.</strong> Ideally within two to four weeks of the course, at our Pearson VUE centre.</li><li><strong>Claim what you are entitled to.</strong> Offset with SkillsFuture Credit or PSEA, and submit your UTAP claim after completion. Then use your 50% AWS retake-or-next-exam voucher to climb the ladder.</li></ol><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="mmd-faq"><details class="mmd-faq-item"><summary class="mmd-faq-q">Is the AWS exam fee included in the course fee?</summary><div class="mmd-faq-a"><p>No. The course fee covers instructor-led training, courseware and the CASL assessment. The SAA-C03 exam costs USD 150 and is paid directly to AWS when you schedule through Pearson VUE. You can sit it at our own Pearson VUE test centre.</p></div></details><details class="mmd-faq-item"><summary class="mmd-faq-q">Do I have to pass the AWS exam to get the funding?</summary><div class="mmd-faq-a"><p>No. Course fee funding depends on attending the course and being assessed competent in the <em>CASL assessment</em>, not on the AWS exam result. Meeting the minimum attendance requirement and passing the assessment secures your subsidy and your Statement of Attainment.</p></div></details><details class="mmd-faq-item"><summary class="mmd-faq-q">What will I actually pay for the course?</summary><div class="mmd-faq-a"><p>Eligible Singapore Citizens and PRs receive up to 70% funding, rising to up to 90% for Singapore Citizens aged 40 and above under MCES. PSEA and UTAP can be applied to the balance. Send us your details and we will confirm your exact nett fee before you commit.</p></div></details><details class="mmd-faq-item"><summary class="mmd-faq-q">Can I sit the AWS exam at your centre?</summary><div class="mmd-faq-a"><p>Yes. AWS certification exams are delivered through Pearson VUE, and Tertiary Infotech Academy is a Pearson VUE Authorized Test Center. Schedule SAA-C03 through your AWS Certification account and select our centre at 12 Woodlands Square. Online proctored delivery via OnVUE is also available if you prefer to sit it remotely.</p></div></details><details class="mmd-faq-item"><summary class="mmd-faq-q">Do I need the recommended experience before enrolling?</summary><div class="mmd-faq-a"><p>AWS recommends at least one year of hands-on experience designing on AWS. Cloud Practitioner is a useful precursor but is not required. AWS recommendations are guidance, not gates - nothing prevents you from enrolling or from sitting the exam. If you are unsure whether to start here or a tier lower, talk to us and we will point you at the right course.</p></div></details><details class="mmd-faq-item"><summary class="mmd-faq-q">What happens if I fail the exam?</summary><div class="mmd-faq-a"><p>You may retake it after a 14-day waiting period, and there is no limit on attempts, though each retake is charged at full price. This is the practical argument for sitting the exam soon after training rather than months later - your first attempt is much more likely to be your only one.</p></div></details><details class="mmd-faq-item"><summary class="mmd-faq-q">How long is the certification valid?</summary><div class="mmd-faq-a"><p>Valid for 3 years. AWS will prompt you to recertify before expiry, and holding a current certification is what signals current knowledge to an employer.</p></div></details></div><h2>Register for AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate training</h2><p>Classes fill ahead of each intake. View upcoming dates and reserve your place on the <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/casl-aws-certified-solutions-architect-associate-training.html"><strong>CASL - AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate Training</strong></a> course page, or call +65 6100 0613 and we will work out your funding first. Then book SAA-C03 - the training is only worth what the certificate proves.</p>',
       'https://pub-77c0dec029944b0386e40673ce81081f.r2.dev/blog/auto-20260824-025348-aws-solutions-architect-saa-c03-resilient-and-scalable-syst.png',
       'Tertiary Infotech Academy', 1, '2025-04-01',
       'TGS-2026064535', 'TGS-2026064535',
       'CASL AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate Singapore | SAA-C03 Guide', 'SAA-C03 exam domains, weightings, exam fee and funding for CASL AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate training in Singapore. Up to 70% course fee funding (90% for age 40+). Sit your AWS exam at our Pearson VUE test centre.', 'aws certified solutions architect - associate, aws certified solutions architect - associate singapore, aws certified solutions architect - associate training, saa-c03 exam, saa-c03 exam domains, aws certification singapore, aws training singapore, skillsfuture aws course, casl aws course, aws exam pearson vue singapore, aws certification worth it, aws certified solutions architect - associate course fee funding',
       101, '2025-04-01 09:00:00', '2025-04-01 09:00:00'
